ptions:"The `{$min}` option must not be greater than the `{$max}` option.",invalid_step:"The `step` option is set to `{$step}`, but it must be greater than zero, or `-1` to turn stepping off.",select_field_no_options:"The Select field must have at least one item in the `options` option.",select_field_duplicate_option:"The Select field’s `options` must be unique, but `{$value}` is used more than once.",select_field_invalid_default:"The Select field’s `default` option is set to `{$value}`, but it’s not one of the `options`.",list_field_no_subfields:"The List field’s `fields` or `types` option must have at least one item. Omit the option for a list of plain values.",list_field_invalid_default_object:"The List field’s `default` option contains an object, but each item must be a plain value because the field has no `fields` or `types`.",list_field_invalid_default_item:"The List field’s `default` option contains `{$value}`, but each item must be an object because the field has `fields` or `types`.",list_field_invalid_default_key:"The List field’s `default` option contains an item with the `{$key}` property, but no subfield has that name.",list_field_default_missing_type:"The List field’s `default` option contains an item without the `{$typeKey}` property, which identifies one of the `types`.",list_field_invalid_default_type:"The List field’s `default` option contains an item whose `{$typeKey}` property is `{$value}`, but it’s not one of the `types`.",list_field_map_key_no_subfields:"The List field’s `map_key_field` option requires the `fields` or `types` option, as each key is taken from a subfield.",list_field_map_key_not_found:"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but no subfield has that name.",list_field_map_key_missing_in_type:"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the `{$type}` type has no subfield with that name.",list_field_map_key_invalid_type:"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but it must be a String, Relation or Select field, not a `{$widget}` field.",list_field_map_key_multiple:"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the subfield can’t take multiple values, as each item needs a single key. Remove its `multiple` option.",list_field_map_key_option_not_string:"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the subfield’s options must have string values, as each key is stored as a string.",list_field_map_key_not_required:"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the subfield can’t be optional, as each item needs a key. Remove its `required` option.",list_field_map_key_not_localized:"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the subfield can’t have `i18n: false`, as the items need a key in every locale. Use `i18n: duplicate` or remove the option.",duplicate_if_empty_multiple:"The `i18n: duplicate_if_empty` option is not supported for a field with the `multiple` option, so the field works like one with `i18n: true`.",invalid_default_multiple:"The `default` option must be an array because the `multiple` option is `true`.",invalid_default_single:"The `default` option must be a single value, not an array, because the `multiple` option is not `true`.",object_field_invalid_default_key:"The Object field’s `default` option has the `{$key}` property, but no subfield has that name.",object_field_default_missing_type:"The Object field’s `default` option doesn’t have the `{$typeKey}` property, which identifies one of the `types`.",object_field_invalid_default_type:"The `{$typeKey}` property of the Object field’s `default` option is `{$value}`, but it’s not one of the `types`.",code_field_invalid_default_object:"The Code field’s `default` option must be a string because the `output_code_only` option is `true`.",code_field_invalid_default_key:"The Code field’s `default` option has the `{$key}` property, but the `keys` option only allows `{$code}` and `{$lang}`.",compute_fie